<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - MEMC lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - MEMC lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said on Friday it downgraded its rating on the shares of MEMC Electronic Materials Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- MEMC reported second quarter earnings of $0.09 per share, including an $0.08 per share gain for an asset sale, compared with $1.12 per share in last year's second quarter.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed at 38-8/16.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
